  "notes": "Parody 'Palantir for family trips' aesthetic: GitHub-dark palette (#0d1117/#161b22/#30363d, #58a6ff blue, #d29922 amber) with green 'UNCLASSIFIED // FAMILY OPS' classification tag, 'command center' framing, tiny tracked uppercase eyebrows (VENUE INTEL, MOVEMENT, CRITICAL CALLS). 2px radii, no shadows, 1px outlines everywhere. Selected list card gets blue border and tinted bg; right aside header tinted #1f2a34 with blue top rule. Venue names in list rendered as amber tracked uppercase stacked words due to narrow column. 'Working as' family switcher acts like a persona/role switch for edits ('Editing as Jiangs'). 'Note to task' buttons convert notes into tasks."
